aling	Protein that forms a complex with Pbp1p that may mediate posttranscriptional regulation of HO endonuclease; involved in propagation of M2 dsRNA satellite of L-A virus; contains a DTG signature typical of retroviral proteases	Mitochondrial malic enzyme, catalyzes the oxidative decarboxylation of malate to pyruvate, which is a key intermediate in sugar metabolism and a precursor for synthesis of several amino acids	Cytoplasmic tyrosyl-tRNA synthetase, class I aminoacyl-tRNA synthetase that aminoacylates tRNA(Tyr), required for cytoplasmic protein synthesis, interacts with positions 34 and 35 of the anticodon of tRNATyr	None	Nucleolar protein required for the normal accumulation of 25S and 5.8S rRNAs, associated with the 27SA2 pre-ribosomal particle; proposed to be involved in the biogenesis of the 60S ribosomal subunit	
